        <mxCell id="p7_c20" value="&lt;b&gt;Notlar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Realm bank client'ları: web-app, mobile-app (PKCE + DPoP), branch-app, partner-acme (client credentials), dmz-exchange-{web,mobile,partner,branch} (client-x509), bff, core-svc, kgateway-internal.&lt;br&gt;• Kullanıcılar (lab): alice, teller. Parolalar keycloak-client-secrets secret'ında, repo'da yok." style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="590" width="800" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
